1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:07,350
1946. Britain pastes one big patch over the Malay states, and calls it the Malayan Union.

2
00:00:07,370 --> 00:00:11,380
The Malays won't have it. And the patch won't lie flat.

3
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:15,900
Ten years later, in London, both sides agree on a date.

4
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:21,200
31st of August, 1957.

5
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:24,700
And Britain lets go.

6
00:00:26,450 --> 00:00:29,950
No war. Just talks, and a lot of paper.
